#: src/strings.ts:2222
msgid ""
"Force push:\n"
"Use this if changes made on this device are not appearing on other devices. This will overwrite the data on the server with the data from this device.\n"
"\n"
"Force pull:\n"
"Use this if changes from other devices are not appearing on this device. This will overwrite the data on this device with the latest data from the server.\n"
"\n"
"**These must only be used for troubleshooting. Using them regularly for sync is not recommended and will lead to unexpected data loss and other issues. If you are having persistent issues with sync, please report them to us at support@streetwriters.co.**"
msgstr ""
"Force push:\n"
"Use this if changes made on this device are not appearing on other devices. This will overwrite the data on the server with the data from this device.\n"
"\n"
"Force pull:\n"
"Use this if changes from other devices are not appearing on this device. This will overwrite the data on this device with the latest data from the server.\n"
"\n"
"**These must only be used for troubleshooting. Using them regularly for sync is not recommended and will lead to unexpected data loss and other issues. If you are having persistent issues with sync, please report them to us at support@streetwriters.co.**Geforceerd verzenden:\n"
"Gebruik dit als wijzigingen op dit apparaat niet op andere apparaten verschijnen. Hiermee worden de gegevens op de server overschreven met die van dit apparaat.\n"
"\n"
"Geforceerd ophalen:\n"
"Gebruik dit als wijzigingen van andere apparaten niet op dit apparaat verschijnen. Hiermee worden de gegevens op dit apparaat overschreven met de nieuwste gegevens van de server.\n"
"\n"
"**Deze opties zijn alleen bedoeld voor probleemoplossing. Ze regelmatig gebruiken voor synchronisatie wordt afgeraden en leidt tot onverwacht gegevensverlies en andere problemen. Als je aanhoudende synchronisatieproblemen hebt, meld deze dan bij support@streetwriters.co.**"

